#: ../../tools/neb_tm_tools.rst:32 8090d7aaa63e4b2fbb1467ac3140024f
msgid ""
"**Description**: Calculate primer melting temperature (Tm) and annealing "
"temperature (Ta) using the NEB Tm Calculator API. Uses thermodynamic "
"nearest-neighbor calculations (SantaLucia 1998) with polymerase-specific "
"salt corrections for accurate PCR temperature predictions. Supports all "
"NEB DNA polymerases including Q5, Phusion, Taq, OneTaq, and custom buffer"
" conditions. When two primers are provided, also calculates the "
"recommended annealing temperature (Ta). Complements the local "
"DNA\\_primer\\_design tool by providing manufacturer-validated Tm values."
" Common polymerase codes: 'q5-0' (Q5 High-Fidelity), 'phusion-0' (Phusion"
" HF Buffer), 'taq-0' (Taq Standard Buffer), 'onetaq-0' (OneTaq Standard "
"Buffer). Use NEB\\_Tm\\_list\\_polymerases to see all available product "
"codes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/neb_tm_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/neb_tm_tools.rst:77
#: 8651cf0990ec439bb21dac82da66ec86 b2fdce40ad0d476f8acb59eead84ce97
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/neb_tm_tools.rst:36 632707dfc6c347caa89ddec82cadbd8a
msgid ""
"``primer_sequence`` (string) (required) Forward primer DNA sequence (5' "
"to 3'). Must contain only A, T, C, G bases and be at least 10 nt long. "
"Example: 'AGCGGATAACAATTTCACACAGGA'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/neb_tm_tools.rst:39 0aad1c8e744e4888b586fc97e7894c73
msgid ""
"``primer_sequence_2`` (string, null) (optional) Optional reverse primer "
"DNA sequence (5' to 3'). When provided, the API also calculates annealing"
" temperature (Ta). Example: 'CCTCACTAAAGGGAACAAAAGCTG'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/neb_tm_tools.rst:42 f906c47570bd4805a9eaeba9f1c04b0c
msgid ""
"``polymerase`` (string, null) (optional) NEB polymerase product code. "
"Determines buffer composition for Tm calculation. Common codes: 'q5-0' "
"(Q5 HF, default), 'phusion-0' (Phusion HF Buffer), 'taq-0' (Taq Standard "
"Buffer), 'onetaq-0' (OneTaq Standard Buffer), 'custom' (specify "
"monovalent\\_salt\\_mm). Use NEB\\_Tm\\_list\\_polymerases for full list."
" Default: 'q5-0'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/neb_tm_tools.rst:45 29173a26e8bd43d0981781cb0c3b2478
msgid ""
"``primer_concentration`` (integer, null) (optional) Primer concentration "
"in nanomolar (nM). Affects Tm calculation. Common values: 200-500 nM. "
"Default: 250."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/neb_tm_tools.rst:48 3bd1cd82953e4820a96865a17cee16a9
msgid ""
"``monovalent_salt_mm`` (integer, null) (optional) Monovalent salt "
"concentration in mM. Only used when polymerase is 'custom'. Typical "
"range: 20-100 mM. Default: 50."
msgstr ""

